(7575214, 1216625, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great capture of a moment shared between a mother and her cub. Love the action and the details seen here.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great capture of a moment shared between a mother and her cub. Love the action and the details seen here.', '2018-07-01 10:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7575216, 1215859, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The chill in the air is soon forgotten once the rays of light break from the mountain top and then the land is blanketed with a magical glow that is beautiful to behold. Well done - beautiful capture of a magical morning!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The chill in the air is soon forgotten once the rays of light break from the mountain top and then the land is blanketed with a magical glow that is beautiful to behold. Well done - beautiful capture of a magical morning!', '2018-07-01 10:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7575217, 1216799, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great action, details and leading lines in this composition of a swimmer racing in the lanes. The splashing water gives a view of a freezed frame action moment  and the swimmers arm and white line lead the eye to the top left corner where it is understood the goal is to finish the race in the best possible time. The grain, I feel, adds to the shot for their is a gritty rawness to this moment - you are brought right to the action as it happens in the here, in the now.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great action, details and leading lines in this composition of a swimmer racing in the lanes. The splashing water gives a view of a freezed frame action moment  and the swimmers arm and white line lead the eye to the top left corner where it is understood the goal is to finish the race in the best possible time. The grain, I feel, adds to the shot for their is a gritty rawness to this moment - you are brought right to the action as it happens in the here, in the now.', '2018-07-01 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7575218, 1217257, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great detail and color in this close-up portrait of a hen.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great detail and color in this close-up portrait of a hen.', '2018-07-01 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7575220, 1217114, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>There is an element of mystery that captivates my eye as I observe the scene you present. Smoke hangs in the air and a bit of flame burning on the dried vegetation. Two stones blocks, the one leaning on the other for support, convey a sense of loss while standing against the erosive elements. Is it all that survived the burn? And the figure off in the distance - is he/she a survivor of the fire that took their home or is it a firefighter seeking to put out the flames? Unknown - there is a story here and one that would be interesting to hear.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. There is an element of mystery that captivates my eye as I observe the scene you present. Smoke hangs in the air and a bit of flame burning on the dried vegetation. Two stones blocks, the one leaning on the other for support, convey a sense of loss while standing against the erosive elements. Is it all that survived the burn? And the figure off in the distance - is he/she a survivor of the fire that took their home or is it a firefighter seeking to put out the flames? Unknown - there is a story here and one that would be interesting to hear.', '2018-07-01 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7575293, 1216625, 65234, '<td valign="top">That is simply adorable! Would love to see something like that in the wild some day. I like the golden light and long shadows here.</td>', 'That is simply adorable! Would love to see something like that in the wild some day. I like the golden light and long shadows here.', '2018-07-01 14:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
