(7576478, 1216324, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Fantastic colors in both the sky and land! What a breathtaking view! Love how the sky is reflected in the staggered rice paddies - it looks like glass in some spots.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Fantastic colors in both the sky and land! What a breathtaking view! Love how the sky is reflected in the staggered rice paddies - it looks like glass in some spots.', '2018-07-03 10:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576486, 1217220, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Just Wow...now that is a dramatic shot! Fantastic composition capturing the orb of the setting sun ''resting'' upon the gallery deck/catwalk and encircling the top portion of this lighthouse!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Just Wow...now that is a dramatic shot! Fantastic composition capturing the orb of the setting sun ''resting'' upon the gallery deck/catwalk and encircling the top portion of this lighthouse!', '2018-07-03 11:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576492, 1215242, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Love the color and details of this photo! Excellent job on capturing the hummingbird in mid-air!Great details in the head and wing of this ruby throat hummingbird as it takes a sip from the flower before zipping off to the next one.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Love the color and details of this photo! Excellent job on capturing the hummingbird in mid-air!Great details in the head and wing of this ruby throat hummingbird as it takes a sip from the flower before zipping off to the next one.', '2018-07-03 11:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576498, 1217238, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Wonderful color and clarity - I like how you captured a moment here. The story that speaks to me is that the horse is taking a drink when all of a sudden a noise breaks the quiet calm. The horse whips it''s head up, water drips in a cascade from its mouth, as the horse looks for the source of the sound.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Wonderful color and clarity - I like how you captured a moment here. The story that speaks to me is that the horse is taking a drink when all of a sudden a noise breaks the quiet calm. The horse whips it''s head up, water drips in a cascade from its mouth, as the horse looks for the source of the sound.', '2018-07-03 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576504, 1216443, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Mysterious and almost spooky even during the day. The light from the partially sunken ornate window with the sun pattern draws the eye in - the open door stands as an invitation to come in and explore the room. I see writing on the window panel frame on the left and it peaks my curiosity as to what it says -brings new meaning to ''if these walls could talk''. My only suggestion on how to further strengthen the ''story'' of this place is the compositional crop. Cropping out the right portion of the wall just up to the right door frame would then make this a vertical shaped picture subtly complimenting the vertical lines of the door frame and the upright blue trunk</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Mysterious and almost spooky even during the day. The light from the partially sunken ornate window with the sun pattern draws the eye in - the open door stands as an invitation to come in and explore the room. I see writing on the window panel frame on the left and it peaks my curiosity as to what it says -brings new meaning to ''if these walls could talk''. My only suggestion on how to further strengthen the ''story'' of this place is the compositional crop. Cropping out the right portion of the wall just up to the right door frame would then make this a vertical shaped picture subtly complimenting the vertical lines of the door frame and the upright blue trunk', '2018-07-03 11:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7576505, 1217262, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Lovely capture showing off all the details and beautiful color on this Stargazer Lilly.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Lovely capture showing off all the details and beautiful color on this Stargazer Lilly.', '2018-07-03 11:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
