(7577287, 1217176, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Literaly - a look behind the scenes. The viewer takes on the role of an actor and gets to see ''backstage''. Get B&amp;W tones and I really like the shadowplay on the brick wall. I think the composition would be stronger if you cropped closer the the main elements - cropping out 1/4 from the left bringing the crop closer to the stage door and those fantastic shadows and you bring those two mains to the center stage.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Literaly - a look behind the scenes. The viewer takes on the role of an actor and gets to see ''backstage''. Get B&W tones and I really like the shadowplay on the brick wall. I think the composition would be stronger if you cropped closer the the main elements - cropping out 1/4 from the left bringing the crop closer to the stage door and those fantastic shadows and you bring those two mains to the center stage.', '2018-07-04 15:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577288, 1216976, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Zebra Aspirations or racing stripes...indeed the reflected strips along the cars is very hypnotic. Good eye to spot this interesting match-up.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Zebra Aspirations or racing stripes...indeed the reflected strips along the cars is very hypnotic. Good eye to spot this interesting match-up.', '2018-07-04 15:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577291, 1216604, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful sunset on the beach. The sky details and colors are lovely. Just my two cents - I do think that the rest of the composition is just a touch overcooked - the hues on the rocks in the forefront on the shore seems a bit too processed. Perhaps pulling back on the warm tones will help or dialing back a touch on the processing a bit.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful sunset on the beach. The sky details and colors are lovely. Just my two cents - I do think that the rest of the composition is just a touch overcooked - the hues on the rocks in the forefront on the shore seems a bit too processed. Perhaps pulling back on the warm tones will help or dialing back a touch on the processing a bit.', '2018-07-04 15:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577293, 1217011, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The words on the playbook appear to spell out the word listen. This photo of this young musician practicing invites the viewer to stay a while and listen. I can see her concentration as she plays. You have a solid foundation but I think the composition could be stronger if it is cropped closer - bring us closer to the music and musician. Crop closer so that the girl playing her instrument fills 90% of the screen and you draw the viewer in more readily.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The words on the playbook appear to spell out the word listen. This photo of this young musician practicing invites the viewer to stay a while and listen. I can see her concentration as she plays. You have a solid foundation but I think the composition could be stronger if it is cropped closer - bring us closer to the music and musician. Crop closer so that the girl playing her instrument fills 90% of the screen and you draw the viewer in more readily.', '2018-07-04 15:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577294, 1217243, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful colors and details in this photo! I especially love the color and details on the orange butterfly. The composition of elements is great too for you have the branch reaching out from the right corner to stretch across the frame. The butterfly is perched on the tip - ready to take flight.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful colors and details in this photo! I especially love the color and details on the orange butterfly. The composition of elements is great too for you have the branch reaching out from the right corner to stretch across the frame. The butterfly is perched on the tip - ready to take flight.', '2018-07-04 15:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577299, 1217156, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The circle of life on full display in this great close-up shot of the insect world. The spider has successfully caught the moth. Fantastic details from the moth wings to the spider, to the leaf.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The circle of life on full display in this great close-up shot of the insect world. The spider has successfully caught the moth. Fantastic details from the moth wings to the spider, to the leaf.', '2018-07-04 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577300, 1216725, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful minimalist capture! Great use of long term exposure to have the water appear smooth and mist like. The rods sticking out of the ground lead like a trail that my eye follows into the water. My only suggestion on how to further strengthen the composition is to crop the frame such that the first rod on the shore is in the bottom left corner. What that would do is strengthen the leading lines of this line allowing the eye to begin the journey at the bottom left corner, follow the line and then explore the ocean beyond.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful minimalist capture! Great use of long term exposure to have the water appear smooth and mist like. The rods sticking out of the ground lead like a trail that my eye follows into the water. My only suggestion on how to further strengthen the composition is to crop the frame such that the first rod on the shore is in the bottom left corner. What that would do is strengthen the leading lines of this line allowing the eye to begin the journey at the bottom left corner, follow the line and then explore the ocean beyond.', '2018-07-04 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577639, 1216981, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love how the line of the Milky Way seems to be coming out of the center tower of the temple.  That said it is a good shot with great clarity and details seen on the Temple. The elements that detract from the two main subjects of the Temple and the Milky Way are the fence and the that light pole on the far right. Easy to remove the pole by cloning it out. The fence while I do understand why they have it there it would be wonderful if it was not in the composition. Hmm, well, I do see that it is a challenge to get it out of frame. Even if you crop just under the feet of the religious figure some of the fence remains on the end corners. My only other thought that *might* have worked is to have the camera higher on the tripod when doing the long exposure photo...in the very least it might have given more room under the Figures feet to crop the fence out of the frame. Aside from all that it certainly looks like an awesome place to see.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love how the line of the Milky Way seems to be coming out of the center tower of the temple.  That said it is a good shot with great clarity and details seen on the Temple. The elements that detract from the two main subjects of the Temple and the Milky Way are the fence and the that light pole on the far right. Easy to remove the pole by cloning it out. The fence while I do understand why they have it there it would be wonderful if it was not in the composition. Hmm, well, I do see that it is a challenge to get it out of frame. Even if you crop just under the feet of the religious figure some of the fence remains on the end corners. My only other thought that *might* have worked is to have the camera higher on the tripod when doing the long exposure photo...in the very least it might have given more room under the Figures feet to crop the fence out of the frame. Aside from all that it certainly looks like an awesome place to see.', '2018-07-05 18:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577646, 1216813, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the early morning light and how it illuminates this scene. There is an early morning mist/haze that adds to the feel of the place. A slight chill in the air along with the excited expectation of the Hot Air Balloons launching into the sky. Wonderful shot showing the viewer all the prep and activity that goes on before Balloon Rise.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the early morning light and how it illuminates this scene. There is an early morning mist/haze that adds to the feel of the place. A slight chill in the air along with the excited expectation of the Hot Air Balloons launching into the sky. Wonderful shot showing the viewer all the prep and activity that goes on before Balloon Rise.', '2018-07-05 18:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577651, 1217235, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great B&amp;W tones, which in my honest opinion, perfectly compliment the ''street photography/journalism'' feel of this capture! The little girl seeks comfort and nestles in her mother''s lap. Perhaps she is tired from a long day of walking. Both are ready to get to their destination. This unfortunately also appears (it is only a small moment in time during the ride) to capture how there is a ''disconnect'' (the mom on the phone) going while there is a connection (the girl nestled up to her mom).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great B&W tones, which in my honest opinion, perfectly compliment the ''street photography/journalism'' feel of this capture! The little girl seeks comfort and nestles in her mother''s lap. Perhaps she is tired from a long day of walking. Both are ready to get to their destination. This unfortunately also appears (it is only a small moment in time during the ride) to capture how there is a ''disconnect'' (the mom on the phone) going while there is a connection (the girl nestled up to her mom).', '2018-07-05 18:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577653, 1217091, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the mood and color in this still life with the dried flowers. I do like that there is texture on the backdrop that adds the sense of touch to the sense of sight. My only critique is that I think that there may be a bit too much empty space above the flowers that they get dwarfed and lost.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the mood and color in this still life with the dried flowers. I do like that there is texture on the backdrop that adds the sense of touch to the sense of sight. My only critique is that I think that there may be a bit too much empty space above the flowers that they get dwarfed and lost.', '2018-07-05 19:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7577657, 1217232, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The colors, the ''soft glow'', and the main subject of the water lilies does capture some of the look and feel of Monet''s work. I do have one suggestion/critique that could strengthen the composition. Cropping off some of the far right portion to be flush with the leaf pad of the pink lilies would bring the main subject more to the forefront and also eliminate that orange reflection that distracts from the pop of color from the flowers.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The colors, the ''soft glow'', and the main subject of the water lilies does capture some of the look and feel of Monet''s work. I do have one suggestion/critique that could strengthen the composition. Cropping off some of the far right portion to be flush with the leaf pad of the pink lilies would bring the main subject more to the forefront and also eliminate that orange reflection that distracts from the pop of color from the flowers.', '2018-07-05 19:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
