(7578173, 1216962, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the clouds and the colors of the sunset and the balloon. Great photo with minimal elements - just the wide open sky and the hot air balloon. That said, there is one suggestion I have that can further strengthen the image. Since the balloon is ''Gliding Through Sunset" the ground plane should be cropped out. It is negative space in dark silhouette that does not add anything to the image.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the clouds and the colors of the sunset and the balloon. Great photo with minimal elements - just the wide open sky and the hot air balloon. That said, there is one suggestion I have that can further strengthen the image. Since the balloon is ''Gliding Through Sunset" the ground plane should be cropped out. It is negative space in dark silhouette that does not add anything to the image.', '2018-07-07 11:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578178, 1216856, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow, that is one dramatic and curvy road in this mountain region! The low hanging clouds add to the dramatic scenery. Very lovely capture!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow, that is one dramatic and curvy road in this mountain region! The low hanging clouds add to the dramatic scenery. Very lovely capture!', '2018-07-07 12:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578183, 1216640, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>This is a very picturesque place to live or visit! Beautiful mountain of green with a gorgeous fjord where the water''s glass-like surface reflects the beauty of Geiranger. The red roofs and walls of the houses really pop off of all the greenery drawing the eye to that section of the composition. My one suggestion on a possible way to strengthen the composition is a closer crop to the area with the houses to give the viewer a main subject to focus on. Perhaps cropping out 1/4 of the left side and on top would still show off all the lovely scenery and it would now bring us closer to the nature as well as those houses which are inviting the viewer to come stay awhile. Give the viewer a closer look so that one can explore.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. This is a very picturesque place to live or visit! Beautiful mountain of green with a gorgeous fjord where the water''s glass-like surface reflects the beauty of Geiranger. The red roofs and walls of the houses really pop off of all the greenery drawing the eye to that section of the composition. My one suggestion on a possible way to strengthen the composition is a closer crop to the area with the houses to give the viewer a main subject to focus on. Perhaps cropping out 1/4 of the left side and on top would still show off all the lovely scenery and it would now bring us closer to the nature as well as those houses which are inviting the viewer to come stay awhile. Give the viewer a closer look so that one can explore.', '2018-07-07 12:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7578215, 1216734, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow, there are such fantastic details in this close-up shot! From the textures on the green leaf to the patterns on body of the insect stretching, this photo brings the viewer into the sphere of this small world to observe it in stunning detail.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow, there are such fantastic details in this close-up shot! From the textures on the green leaf to the patterns on body of the insect stretching, this photo brings the viewer into the sphere of this small world to observe it in stunning detail.', '2018-07-07 13:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
