(7578614, 1216625, 67258, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon, Lev - easily my favourite of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Edit to add, thank you for posting the story behind the shot - your awe and excitement adds to the photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-07-08 03:59:15.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon, Lev - easily my favourite of the challenge. Edit to add, thank you for posting the story behind the shot - your awe and excitement adds to the photo.', '2018-07-08 04:58:26.000000', '2018-07-08 04:59:15.000000', 0),
(7578615, 1216625, 62357, '<td valign="top">Favourite from this FS.  What an fabulous experience.  I have found those early morning starts always to be worthwhile.  I look forward to seeing more of the thousands you took.  This for me was far and away the best in this FS.</td>', 'Favourite from this FS.  What an fabulous experience.  I have found those early morning starts always to be worthwhile.  I look forward to seeing more of the thousands you took.  This for me was far and away the best in this FS.', '2018-07-08 05:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
